---

---

<section
  id="olhar"
  class="bg-[var(--cor-fundo-suave)] pt-8 pb-8 px-6 lg:px-12 scroll-mt-36"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
      <div
        class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/35 shadow-xs flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0"
      >
        👁️
      </div>
      <div class="text-left">
        <h2
          class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[var(--cor-texto)] leading-tight"
        >
          Cílios, Sobrancelhas &amp; Linha
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-light">
          Definição morfológica e expressão desenhada para realçar o seu rosto
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-7 items-stretch"
    >
      <!-- LIFTING DE PESTANAS (TOP) -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-white p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/30 hover:border-[var(--cor-destaque)]/40 shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[rgba(212,49,136,0.06)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <span
          class="absolute -top-3 right-7 bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)] text-[#1a1217] text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-xs"
        >
          TOP
        </span>
        <div>
          <h3
            class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[var(--cor-texto)] group-hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors duration-300 mb-2 leading-snug"
          >
            Lifting de Pestanas
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--cor-destaque)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3"
          >
            Lash Lifting &amp; Tintura
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] leading-relaxed font-light mb-8"
          >
            Curvatura duradoura das pestanas naturais desde a raiz, com
            pigmentação profunda para um olhar volumoso e aberto sem recurso a
            rímel.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="pt-4 border-t border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/20 flex items-center justify-between"
        >
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-medium"
          >
            <span>🕒</span>
            <span>45–60 min</span>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/351919786224?text=Ol%C3%A1!+Gostaria+de+marcar+Lifting+de+Pestanas+na+Klassy."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--cor-destaque)] group-hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque-hover)] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
          >
            <span>Marcar</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- EXTENSÃO DE PESTANAS -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-white p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/30 hover:border-[var(--cor-destaque)]/40 shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[rgba(212,49,136,0.06)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div>
          <h3
            class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[var(--cor-texto)] group-hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors duration-300 mb-2 leading-snug"
          >
            Extensão de Pestanas
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--cor-secundaria)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3"
          >
            Aplicação &amp; Manutenção
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] leading-relaxed font-light mb-8"
          >
            Colocação fio a fio ou volume personalizado com adesivos
            certificados, respeitando a integridade das pestanas naturais.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="pt-4 border-t border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/20 flex items-center justify-between"
        >
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-medium"
          >
            <span>🕒</span>
            <span>90–120 min</span>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/351919786224?text=Ol%C3%A1!+Gostaria+de+marcar+Extens%C3%A3o+de+Pestanas+na+Klassy."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--cor-destaque)] group-hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque-hover)] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
          >
            <span>Marcar</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- THREADING (DEPILAÇÃO À LINHA) -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-white p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/30 hover:border-[var(--cor-destaque)]/40 shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[rgba(212,49,136,0.06)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div>
          <h3
            class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[var(--cor-texto)] group-hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque)] transition-colors duration-300 mb-2 leading-snug"
          >
            Depilação à Linha (Threading)
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3"
          >
            Sobrancelha • Buço • Rosto
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] leading-relaxed font-light mb-8"
          >
            Técnica milenar precisa e higiénica que retira o pelo pela raiz sem
            químicos, sem puxar a pele e sem provocar flacidez ou irritação.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="pt-4 border-t border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/20 flex items-center justify-between"
        >
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-medium"
          >
            <span>🕒</span>
            <span>15–30 min</span>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/351919786224?text=Ol%C3%A1!+Gostaria+de+marcar+Threading+na+Klassy."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--cor-destaque)] group-hover:text-[var(--cor-destaque-hover)] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
          >
            <span>Marcar</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
